/0c6dbadf3ec724d6651d82fb00e5245e.webp?t=1609874862\" /></div> <br>Surviving in an island could appears difficult when you are starting, you will need to manage your basic necessities, eat, drink and sleep. Every day in the island you will need to find food, water and a good place to sleep if you dont want to die. Also you will need to protect from dangerous animals and avoid not secure places.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/696250/extras/0dbba55a3f019ac574e5272d8bb582f1.webp?t=1609874862\" /></div> <br>In this game you can create your own constructions, from a stick man to a very complex houses made with sticks, the only limit is your imagination. With the creative construction mode, you will able to make any thing by adding any resources that you wants like rocks, planks, palm leaves, leaves, bamboo, trunks, etc. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/696250/extras/1f89546beae750966b5563944b36e3b7.webp?t=1609874862\" /></div> <br>Share your custom constructions with other players and download others useful players constructions for use them in your stay on the island.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FUTURE IMPLEMENTATIONS</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> ONLINE MULTIPLAYER PVP &amp; COOP<br></li><li> HISTORY MODE<br></li><li> MISSIONS AND REWARDS<br></li><li> PIRATE ENEMIES</li></ul>",
